Static assets are served from this directory and copied into the runtime image
by the Dockerfile. It must exist in the repository even while empty, otherwise
the image build fails at the COPY step.

Populated during Phase 2 of the UI work: Tailwind output (css/app.css), HTMX,
Alpine, and Chart.js. css/app.css is generated and therefore gitignored, which
is why this file — not that one — is what keeps the directory tracked.
